    "name": "Irene. The Window",
    "steam_appid": 3484890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.poster.avif?t=1755217276\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.webm?t=1755217276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.mp4?t=1755217276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/30a7520daa310f47ec4bed4066cb113c.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Irene. The Window</strong></i> is a text-based interactive story. You get a call from Irene, your friend back from college. Day after day, you get to know her better as you chat about everything and nothing at all. Irene has an opinion about every little thing, from job choices to food-related pet peeves - and she wants to know yours. Choose between options in the branching narrative and answer honestly, your friend won\u2019t judge (but will totally roast you if it\u2019s really funny).   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/ad0fee1c150a8ff58434f37956032045.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, Irene will give you a simple task to complete in real life. She does it for her own reasons, and you can always say \u201cno\u201d - but what if agreeing could break the mold of your daily routine, if only a bit?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/4b5e24f2bab8fdb10549a0f6593a3751.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a web of idle chatter, the true story of Irene emerges: at times thrilling, at times tragic, and too often relatable. She will never ask you for it, but you can help her resolve some of her issues - and make her peace with others.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.poster.avif?t=1755217276\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.webm?t=1755217276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/d3e7372d42e2e5410cf2408c6ef05725.mp4?t=1755217276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/30a7520daa310f47ec4bed4066cb113c.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Irene. The Window</strong></i> is a text-based interactive story. You get a call from Irene, your friend back from college. Day after day, you get to know her better as you chat about everything and nothing at all. Irene has an opinion about every little thing, from job choices to food-related pet peeves - and she wants to know yours. Choose between options in the branching narrative and answer honestly, your friend won\u2019t judge (but will totally roast you if it\u2019s really funny).   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/ad0fee1c150a8ff58434f37956032045.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, Irene will give you a simple task to complete in real life. She does it for her own reasons, and you can always say \u201cno\u201d - but what if agreeing could break the mold of your daily routine, if only a bit?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484890/extras/4b5e24f2bab8fdb10549a0f6593a3751.avif?t=1755217276\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a web of idle chatter, the true story of Irene emerges: at times thrilling, at times tragic, and too often relatable. She will never ask you for it, but you can help her resolve some of her issues - and make her peace with others.</p>",
    "short_description": "Reconnect with an old friend. Discuss your daily lives, past loves, and talking snakes. Get up and do things in real life because she asks you to. Become closer and stay until the very end.",
